# Pages captured from alza.sk and used as offline test fixtures. Keep them
# byte-for-byte as fetched: they are recorded evidence of what the site actually
# served, and letting Git rewrite their line endings on checkout would quietly
# change the input the parser tests are pinned to.
backend/AlzaWatchdog.Tests/Fixtures/*.html -text

# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers. A CRLF checkout on Windows would
# make the interpreter line unusable and the container would fail to start.
*.sh text eol=lf
